# Forge snapshots are ephemeral session state for surviving compaction, not
# deliverables. They duplicate .forge/*.md by design and preserve pre-redaction
# copies, so committing them would re-introduce content that was deliberately
# corrected. Regenerated by scripts/snapshot.sh whenever needed.
.forge/snapshots/

# Browser-tool screenshot debris from the design phase: hash-named JPEGs, no
# reference anywhere in EVIDENCE.md, and superseded by the deliberate captures
# in .forge/evidence/ which carry descriptive names. 2.6 MB that would land in
# the repository on a `git add .`.
.forge/shots/
